            0.335,
            0.764,
            0.356
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "For guesstimate problems, make a guess first before solving."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.139,
            0.36,
            0.721,
            0.418
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Estimate how many scoops of ice cream can be obtained from a cuboidal container of dimensions 10 cm × 15 cm × 20 cm."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.138,
            0.423,
            0.722,
            0.501
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. A cube of integer side length a is made of unit cubes. Write an expression giving the number of unit cubes to be added to make a cube of side length a + 1."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
